        "created_at": "2016-01-27T17:45:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Played a little too fast and loose and ended up losing Ra and Fanatic early, but Argent Adept and Scholar kept healing like crazy and Mortal Form to Energy and the Tomb of Anubis were tearing the Ennead apart. &nbsp;All told, six of them showed up by the end of the fight, but I got my Mint.</p>",
