        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"schadkehnfreude\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/schadkehnfreude/48/2357_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> schadkehnfreude:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hm - I musta gotten a <strong>really</strong> optimal setup because I minted this one and it wasn't particularly close.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The game starts the same for everyone so likely you just made the most optimal choices the first time. &nbsp;</p>",
