        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-27T18:49:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>schadkehnfreude wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Hm - I musta gotten a <strong>really</strong> optimal setup because I minted this one and it wasn't particularly close.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nThe game starts the same for everyone so likely you just made the most optimal choices the first time. &nbsp;\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Randomization effects can change decks during the game. So incap shuffling effects can randomize things for people.</p>",
