      {
        "id": 156283,
        "name": "ClericalError",
        "username": "ClericalError",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/clericalerror/{size}/2396_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-28T11:06:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is my first non-mint! I had a read of what everyone was saying and it looked really easy, but I must have made some very poor decisions. I got finished off by the card that \"destroy all environment card, deal X damage to all targets equal to number of cards destroyed this way\" and they board wiped me. :(</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>EDIT: Near Mint. :(</p>",
