      {
        "id": 156284,
        "name": "mlangsdorf",
        "username": "mlangsdorf",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/c4cdca/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-30T00:50:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>ClericalError, I had the Ennead play the Desert's Wrath (destroy all environments, do X damage to all heroes) immediately after Urshe revealed 5 trials in my test game. It's pretty annoying (nearly unavoidable 6 projectile damage for everyone) but since there's nothing you can do to avoid it, I had no plan to counter it other than \"hope that doesn't come up.\"</p><p>I'm sorry the deck shuffle hit you with a similar combination and took you out. At least your next play-through went better.</p>",
