      {
        "id": 156285,
        "name": "Honolulu Blue",
        "username": "Honolulu_Blue",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/ecae2f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-30T01:16:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Another week, another mint cover.&nbsp; Ra and Argent Adept went down the turn before the last of the Ennead bit it, and Fanatic was down to 2 HP.&nbsp; The Scholar was at almost full health; Flesh to Iron absorbed an incredible amount of damage.</p><p>It's good to hear that others have a full collection of mint covers also.&nbsp; I wonder how my streak will end.&nbsp; Will it be because I'm too far away from Internet access for too long? Or because I face a challenge I can't beat?&nbsp; Or will the random villain wheel land on Spite?&nbsp; Stay tuned.</p>",
